 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing discomfort",
     "texto": [
      "**Svimmel** means «dizzy»; **hoven**, «swollen». **Utslett** is a rash on the skin. To ask if it itches, you can say **Klør det?** («Does it itch?»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about an accident",
     "texto": [
      "**Å falle** means «to fall» and its past is irregular: **falt** («I fell / he fell»). To say where it hurts, you say **vondt i kneet** («pain in the knee»); **kne** is neuter and its definite form is **kneet**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
